  "body": [
    "Say hello to  Quinn,  our shining example of quintessential campervan design! This custom campervan is the rolling home to the fantastic duo, Karley and Danny, and their adorable Australian Shepherd. Follow their exhilarating adventures across the country on Instagram, as they explore off-grid living in Quinn.",
    "Quinn isn't just any van; it's a 170 Wheelbase Mercedes Sprinter, expertly fitted to facilitate long-term adventures. With a robust 600Ah Lithium Iron Phosphate battery, a 30-gallon freshwater tank, and a 400-watt solar power system, it’s ready to roam. Not to forget the efficient 12V Dometic RTX-2000 A/C unit to keep them cool in the heat.",
    "But the wow factor doesn't stop there. Inside Quinn, you'll find a full shower and a magnificent kitchen. Here, meals are crafted on a custom dual-burner propane stove, making it feel just like home. Quinn truly epitomizes the spirit of endless exploration and comfortable living on the road. Join Karley, Danny, and their furry companion as they redefine the art of travel!"
  ],
